(3) [The sceptic backs the field]: The faith-vetoer "is actively playing his stake as much as the believer is; he is backing the field against the religious hypothesis, just as the believer is backing the religious hypothesis against the field." {fidelity: "compression", pinpoint: "p. 26", about: [{stance: wait, backs: field}, {stance: believe, backs: hypothesis}]}
