(5) [No proof that dupery through hope is worse than dupery through fear]: "Dupery for dupery, what proof is there that dupery through hope is so much worse than dupery through fear? I, for one, can see no proof" {fidelity: "quotation", pinpoint: "p. 27", about: [{stance: wait, yields: fear}, {stance: believe, yields: hope}]}
-- {uses: [4, 5]} --
