(6) [Religion is a momentous option]: "religion offers itself as a momentous option. We are supposed to gain, even now, by our belief, and to lose by our non-belief, a certain vital good." {fidelity: "quotation", pinpoint: "p. 26", about: {option: religion, momentous: momentous}, causes: {from: relbelief, to: good, sign: "+", basis: asserted, chain: religion, given: ["in case the religious hypothesis be really true"]}}
